  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals x plus eight elevenths\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by the given equation. What is the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> when <math alttext=\"x equals three elevenths\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t<mn>11</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
